1
00:00:00,694 --> 00:00:03,454
The theme:
Movies that killed their franchises.

2
00:00:03,631 --> 00:00:09,541
(Leonard:)Oh.
Like Jaws 4, Indiana Jones 4, Daredevil 1.

3
00:00:10,838 --> 00:00:13,498
Miss Congeniality 2: Armed and Fabulous.

4
00:00:13,707 --> 00:00:18,907
I mean, you know a movie's bad
when my homegirl Sandy B can't save it.

5
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:22,008
(Leonard:)Penny's working tonight. I'm in.

6
00:00:22,216 --> 00:00:25,676
(Howard:)Not me. I'm having dinner with Bernadette
and her parents.

7
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:28,650
- Fun. We know how much you love that.
- It's torture.

8
00:00:28,856 --> 00:00:31,656
(Howard:)Especially with her dad.
We have nothing in common.

9
00:00:31,859 --> 00:00:34,849
(Sheldon:)You know what I like to do
when I'm forced to speak with those...

10
00:00:35,062 --> 00:00:37,432
(Sheldon:)...beneath my intellectual station?

11
00:00:37,631 --> 00:00:39,461
(Sheldon:)I bring up an interesting topic...

12
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:43,727
(Sheldon:)...like the difference between
Spider-Man and spiders.

13
00:00:45,506 --> 00:00:48,036
(Howard:)Thanks, Sheldon.
I'll try that with my father-in-law.

14
00:00:48,242 --> 00:00:50,142
(Sheldon:)No, you can't use that one. That's mine.

15
00:00:50,344 --> 00:00:51,714
(Sheldon:)Try this one for an icebreaker.

16
00:00:51,879 --> 00:00:53,509
(Sheldon:)Uh, despite popular lore...

17
00:00:53,714 --> 00:00:57,544
(Sheldon:)...there is no place in the continental
United States, Alaska or Hawaii...

18
00:00:57,751 --> 00:01:02,021
(Sheldon:)...from which one can dig straight through
the center of the Earth and come up in China.

19
00:01:04,258 --> 00:01:06,088
(Howard:)Great. Thank you.

20
00:01:06,494 --> 00:01:09,394
(Sheldon:)Actually, you can't have that one either.
It's too good. Sorry.

21
00:01:09,597 --> 00:01:11,567
(Raj:)What about you, Sheldon?
Do you have plans?

22
00:01:11,765 --> 00:01:15,565
(Sheldon:)Sadly, yes. Amy's taking me
to a memorial service.

23
00:01:15,769 --> 00:01:18,499
(Sheldon:)It's for one of her colleagues
who is of Asian descent...

24
00:01:18,706 --> 00:01:21,836
(Sheldon:)...so my planned conversational gambit
is to casually remark...

25
00:01:22,042 --> 00:01:27,102
(Sheldon:)...that no matter how deep they dig his grave,
he'll never make his way back to China.

26
00:01:29,383 --> 00:01:31,513
(Leonard:)That should lighten the mood.

27
00:01:31,719 --> 00:01:36,029
What can I say, I put the "fun" in funeral.

